# ==============================================================================
# GULF HILLS CONTRACTING — REST API ENDPOINTS TEST COLLECTION (.http)
# Canonical Base URL: https://hedabkh.com.sa (or http://localhost:3000 for local dev)
# ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### 1. System Health Check
# @name getHealth
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Deployment Readiness Probe
# @name getReadiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ready
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Admin Authentication Login
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### 4. Check Current Session Status
# @name checkSession
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Query Master CMS Data
# @name getCmsData
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/cms
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Mutate CMS Data Payload
# @name updateCmsData
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/cms
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "version": "1.0",
  "data": {
    "companyNameAr": "شركة هضاب الخليج للمقاولات العامة",
    "companyNameEn": "Gulf Hills Contracting Co."
  }
}

###

### 7. Query Visual CMS Page & Block Tree Hierarchy
# @name getVisualCmsPage
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/visual-cms?pageId=page-home
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Save Visual CMS Page Composition
# @name saveVisualCmsPage
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/visual-cms
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "pageId": "page-home",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "block-hero-1",
      "type": "heroBanner",
      "isVisible": true,
      "config": {
        "titleAr": "شركة هضاب الخليج للمقاولات",
        "titleEn": "Gulf Hills Contracting Company",
        "subtitleAr": "الريادة والتميز في مشاريع البنية التحتية والإنشاءات الهندسية",
        "subtitleEn": "Excellence in Saudi Infrastructure & Engineering Projects"
      }
    }
  ]
}

###

### 9. Query Central Media Library
# @name getMediaLibrary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/media
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. List Automated Backups
# @name getBackups
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/backup
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. Trigger New Automated Cryptographic Backup
# @name createBackup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/backup
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "reason": "Pre-deployment automated snapshot"
}

###

### 12. Logout Admin Session
# @name adminLogout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}
